## and only then a clock.
#
# Arm b is measured INSIDE arm a's process: the floor implementation is emitted into
# a package of its own (ak.floor) over the same facade types, so the floor-against-
# target ratio is paired inside one round (R4) rather than formed across two
# processes. Arm c is a separate process by construction and stands alone.
#
# In arm c ak.floor and ak.shapes are the SAME emitted source, so its ARM B rows are
# a positive control: they must read zero, and what they read instead is this
# harness's noise floor on that runtime.

